{"id":"n56428-1-6","stage":1,"title":"바닷가 · 海边","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56428-1-6-1","ko":"이번 여름휴가에는 뭘 하실 거예요?","zh":"这次夏季休假打算做什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"여름휴가에는","meaning":"暑假，暑期休假","explanation":"여름휴가：暑假，暑期休假；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여름휴가","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22667","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름휴가에는","audio":"/audio/7e7aba4ea5e48a8f79bb.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"하실","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하실","audio":"/audio/d193919346028a46481b.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"2f326418aa384e84","term":"여름휴가","zh":"暑假，暑期休假","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3","entryId":"22667","definition":"在夏季上学或上班的人在一定期间休息。","pronunciation":["여름휴가"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/c3f68de3fc26dab93c8f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56428-1-6-2","ko":"가족들이랑 바닷가에서 캠핑을 하려고 해요.","zh":"我打算和家人去海边露营。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가족들이랑","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족들이랑","audio":"/audio/f90a1cd7ae43f51544d9.mp3"}},{"text":"바닷가에서","meaning":"海边，海滨","explanation":"바닷가：海边，海滨；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"바닷가","audio":"/audio/edee03fff87eddb66cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56428","senseId":"1","lemma":"바닷가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닷가에서","audio":"/audio/657873677762583d2e55.mp3"}},{"text":"캠핑을","meaning":"露营，野营","explanation":"캠핑：露营，野营；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"캠핑","audio":"/audio/9c7b5f54fcddd12b2513.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83129","senseId":"1","lemma":"캠핑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"캠핑을","audio":"/audio/5607cc59e926d3c4cdc3.mp3"}},{"text":"하려고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하려고","audio":"/audio/761078da9d37d7327667.mp3"}},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"edee03fff87eddb6","term":"바닷가","zh":"海边，海滨","audio":"/audio/edee03fff87eddb66cb9.mp3","entryId":"56428","definition":"大海和陆地相连的地方或其附近。","pronunciation":["바다까","바닫까"]},{"id":"9c7b5f54fcddd12b","term":"캠핑","zh":"露营，野营","audio":"/audio/9c7b5f54fcddd12b2513.mp3","entryId":"83129","definition":"在山上、野外或海边搭建帐篷生活；或指这样的生活。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/419ee6c3e443a282ba64.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56428","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":56,"sequenceScore":2.4607,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这次夏季休假打算做什么？","我打算和家人去海边露营。","您是哪里不舒服才来医院的呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这次夏季休假打算做什么？","我打算和家人去海边露营。","您是哪里不舒服才来医院的呢？"],"answer":1}]}
